{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01339","headline":"相和歌辞 倢伃怨 · 刘氏云","name":"相和歌辞 倢伃怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君恩不可见，妾岂如秋扇。\n秋扇尚有时，妾身永微贱。\n莫言朝花不复落，娇容几夺昭阳殿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘氏云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}